## External Libraries
> Why not try Owl with other fantastic open source libraries? Check the list of plugins I've used in some of the demos.


### Animate.css
Animate.css provides additional CSS animations that can be used with the `animateIn` and `animateOut` options.
* [Visit the Animate.css website](https://animate.style/)
* [See Owl animate demo](../demos/animate.html)

-----

### jQuery Mouse Wheel
A jQuery plugin created by Brandon Aaron that adds normalized mouse-wheel events.

* [Visit jQuery Mousewheel website](https://github.com/brandonaaron/jquery-mousewheel)
* [See Owl mousewheel demo](../demos/mousewheel.html)

-----
External libraries are optional and are not bundled in the Owl Carousel distribution.

{{/markdown }}
